DATA='Rotational energy|K=I*w^2/2|K,I,w|0+s|Fixed-axis rotation.|P:2,-I*w^2;P:-w^2,2*K;P:-I,0,2*K\nAngular momentum|ang=I*w|ang,I,w|s+s|Fixed axis, rigid-body component.|P:1,-I*w;P:-w,ang;P:-I,ang\nAngular impulse|ang=tor*t|ang,tor,t|ss0|ang here means CHANGE in angular momentum.|P:1,-t*tor;P:-t,ang;P:-tor,ang\nSpin conservation|I1*w0=I2*wf|I1,w0,I2,wf|+s+s|Zero net external torque.|P:w0,-I2*wf;P:I1,-I2*wf;P:-wf,I1*w0;P:-I2,I1*w0\nRotation work|W=tor*dtheta|W,tor,dtheta|sss|Constant torque; radians.|P:1,-dtheta*tor;P:-dtheta,W;P:-tor,W\nRotation power|P=tor*w|P,tor,w|sss|Same-axis components.|P:1,-tor*w;P:-w,P;P:-tor,P\nRolling total energy|K=m*v^2/2+I*v^2/(2*r^2)|K,m,v,I,r|0+s++|Rolling without slipping; I through COM.|P:2*r^2,-I*v^2 - m*r^2*v^2;P:-r^2*v^2,-I*v^2 + 2*K*r^2;P:-I - m*r^2,0,2*K*r^2;P:-v^2,2*K*r^2 - m*r^2*v^2;P:2*K - m*v^2,0,-I*v^2\nRolling incline accel|a=g*sin(th)/(1+I/(m*r^2))|a,th,I,m,r|ss+++|Rolling without slipping; enough static friction.|P:I + m*r^2,-g*m*r^2*sin(th);E:;P:a,a*m*r^2 - g*m*r^2*sin(th);P:a*r^2 - g*r^2*sin(th),I*a;P:a*m - g*m*sin(th),0,I*a\nParticle angular mom|ang=m*v*r*sin(th)|ang,m,v,r,th|s+s+s|th between r and v; about chosen origin.|P:1,-m*r*v*sin(th);P:-r*v*sin(th),ang;P:-m*r*sin(th),ang;P:-m*v*sin(th),ang;E:'
